{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Traffic Jam Challenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash streetlights, billboards, barrels, and barricades. Every hit drives your points higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Link crashes, explosions, and takedowns into one relentless streak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/b411188a0f140b34433f3bbb33267c30.poster.avif?t=1769016190\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/b411188a0f140b34433f3bbb33267c30.webm?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/b411188a0f140b34433f3bbb33267c30.mp4?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as sparks fly, fire spreads, and smoke raise.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/592acf49dbe8d5e809f238a01f9cf92c.poster.avif?t=1769016190\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/592acf49dbe8d5e809f238a01f9cf92c.webm?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/592acf49dbe8d5e809f238a01f9cf92c.mp4?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you go, the harder you hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/27de4f3657af4db278b6d817385ea82d.poster.avif?t=1769016190\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/27de4f3657af4db278b6d817385ea82d.webm?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/27de4f3657af4db278b6d817385ea82d.mp4?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rush Hour Challenge:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pass through all checkpoints before the timer runs out, each checkpoint gives you more time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But watch out the traffic, they don't know how to drive and want revenge for what you did in the traffic jam challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/7f031a075f40c6e62a48ff09e42e0725.poster.avif?t=1769016190\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/7f031a075f40c6e62a48ff09e42e0725.webm?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/7f031a075f40c6e62a48ff09e42e0725.mp4?t=1769016190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New rides:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each challenge completed give you stars to unlock new challenges and vehicles that changes how you drive. Heavier, faster, or a fuel barrel on wheels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras/8b166f3d3c396109f28cc2e55f764080.poster.avif?t=1769016190\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980070/extras